i wanna make a mobile app, that users need to pay to can use, and windows app, i mean they need to login, and when they login, i can see they are premium user or regular user, so we need a payment system, we are small company in UK, do u think paypall is good? i saw a lot of website use stripe, is it easier option? i wanna in 1 2 day i can start selling, what u think? anlayse and search and tell me what is the best way!

