- Stripe Billing is fine.

If you want to sell globally from day 1 and do not want tax admin:
- Consider a merchant-of-record like Paddle, or Stripe’s [Managed Payments](https://stripe.com/en-li/pricing), instead of plain Stripe for web sales.

