|---|---|---:|---|
| Stripe | UK-first, direct web/Windows sales, strong dev tooling matters most | Stripe Checkout UK cards: `1.5% + 20p`; Stripe Billing recurring: `0.7%`; Stripe Tax no-code: `0.5%` if used | Best default for your case if you launch fast and can own tax/compliance |
| PayPal | You want PayPal wallet acceptance or already know your buyers want it | PayPal UK “all other commercial transactions”: `2.9% + 0.30 GBP`; some card-focused flows are `1.2% + fixed fee` depending on product | Usable, but not my recommended first setup for a login-based subscription app |
| Paddle | You want merchant-of-record handling for global digital sales | `5% + 50¢` all-in | Higher fee, but strongest “tiny team / global / low-ops” choice |
| Stripe Managed Payments | You want MoR-like help while staying in Stripe | `3.5%` per successful Managed Payments transaction in addition to Stripe Payments fees | Interesting, but pub

