ASSUMPTIONS

- I assumed you are selling digital premium access or premium features, not physical goods or offline services.
- I assumed your Windows app can be distributed directly from your website, even if Microsoft Store may come later.
- I assumed you want account-based premium access, likely subscription-based, rather than a device-only one-time unlock.
- I assumed your Apple and Google store setups may not already be fully approved, so I treated mobile as high-risk for a 1 to 2 day launch.
- I assumed speed to first revenue matters more than offering every payment method on day 1.
